{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A vast empty sky, an old digital camera, and a home in the clouds\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mom has been gone for a while, and the once teeming environment has grown quiet without her careful maintenance. Equipped with a magic flute and the support of your computer friends, it\u2019s up to you to bring abundance back to an empty sky\u2026 all on the back of a giant, flying catfish!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Wide Open Sky is Running out of Catfish is a story-driven photography game which explores themes of friendship and the impermanence of time and place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Giant Catfish!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your catfish lonely? No problem! Soar through the sky and transform clouds into fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/dde85786d9b523abe0a822ed08ddbb3d.poster.avif?t=1757696393\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/dde85786d9b523abe0a822ed08ddbb3d.webm?t=1757696393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/dde85786d9b523abe0a822ed08ddbb3d.mp4?t=1757696393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take Photos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document your findings! Catalog dozens of unique creatures and share your discoveries with the world below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/3505cec7dbb1a7382707ed27fc14fda1.poster.avif?t=1757696393\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/3505cec7dbb1a7382707ed27fc14fda1.webm?t=1757696393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/3505cec7dbb1a7382707ed27fc14fda1.mp4?t=1757696393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surf the Web!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with your computer friends in Dolphin Chat! Upload your work to PhotoPond! Computers can do anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/871b7ae9071b39f5eba9eed8e6996574.poster.avif?t=1757696393\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/871b7ae9071b39f5eba9eed8e6996574.webm?t=1757696393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/871b7ae9071b39f5eba9eed8e6996574.mp4?t=1757696393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Curious!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets of the sky are all around you! Never stop exploring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/c28052eb35a08a8f08b2fe49990eefc4.poster.avif?t=1757696393\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/c28052eb35a08a8f08b2fe49990eefc4.webm?t=1757696393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172760/extras/c